{"slug":"461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare","title":"ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು ಬಂದಿದ್ದಾರೆ!","titleEn":"Atithigalu Bandiddaare","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":461858,"authors":["Kanchan Bannerjee"],"illustrators":["Jui Chitale"],"translators":["Hema Khurshapur"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2022","originalStory":{"title":"पाहुणे आले!"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Atithigalu Bandiddaare!’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು ಬಂದಿದ್ದಾರೆ! (Kannada), translated by Hema Khurshapur, based on original story पाहुणे आले!, written by Kanchan Bannerjee, illustrated by Jui Chitale, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Girl feeding a bird","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":3,"title":"Girl pointing a bird","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":4,"title":"A crow and a sparrow","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":5,"title":"Girl looking at a pigeon","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"A girl feeding to the duck","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl watching a peacock","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl feeding to a parrot","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl watching a owl","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl talking to great herons","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"Different Birds surrounded to a girl","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Mother holding a cake and the girl is dancing","illustrator":"Jui Chitale","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅಮ್ಮಾ, ನೋಡಿಲ್ಲಿ. ಇಬ್ಬರು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು ಬಂದಿದ್ದಾರೆ.","ಗುಬ್ಬಕ್ಕ ಮತ್ತು ಮೈನಾ ಅಕ್ಕ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಓಹ್ ಇದೇನು? ಕೋಗಿಲೆ ಅತ್ತೆ ಕೂಡ!","ಮೂರು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಕಾಗೆ ಚಿಕ್ಕಪ್ಪ, ಬನ್ನಿ ಬನ್ನಿ.","ನಾಲ್ಕು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಪಾರಿವಾಳ ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮ ಬಂದಳು.","ಅಮ್ಮ, ಐದು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ ಬನ್ನಿ ಬಾತುಕೋಳಿ ದೊಡ್ಡಮ್ಮ.","ಆರು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":501},"text":["ಅರೆ! ವಾಹ್! ನನ್ನ ನವಿಲು ತಾತ.","ಈಗ ಏಳು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಆಹ್! ಒಳಗೆ ಬಂದು ಕುಳಿತುಕೊ, ಗಿಳಿರಾಮ.","ಎಂಟು ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಗೂಬೆ ಅಣ್ಣನೂ ಬಂದ.","ಈಗ ಅತಿಥಿಗಳ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ ಒಂಬತ್ತು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಬೆಳ್ಳಕ್ಕಿ ಮಾವ,","ನೀವು ಯಾಕೆ ನಿಂತಿದ್ದೀರಿ?"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಹತ್ತು ಮಂದಿ ಅತಿಥಿಗಳು.","ಆದರೆ, ನಿಮಗೆ ಯಾರು ಹೇಳಿದ್ದು..."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461858-atithigalu-bandiddaare/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["...ಇವತ್ತು ನನ್ನ ಹುಟ್ಟುಹಬ್ಬ ಎಂದು?","ಅಮ್ಮಾ, ಇವರನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನೀನೇ ಕರೆದಿದ್ದು ತಾನೆ?"]}],"wordCount":77}